    {
      "sentence_id": 4,
      "text": "1. Heard Mr. Prahlad Panda, counsel for the applicants and Ms. Sunita Sahu, PL for the State-Respondent.\n2. This is the first bail application filed under Section 483 of the BNSS, 2023 for grant of regular bail to the applicant who has been arrested in connection with Crime No.123/2024 registered at Police Station Chaal, District Raigarh (C.G.), for the offence punishable under Sections 363, 366, 376(2)(n)\nof IPC, Sections 4 & 6 of the POCSO Act and Section 3(ii)(v) of the SC/ST Act.\n3. After arguing the matter at length, learned counsel for the applicants prays for withdrawal of the instant MCRC.\n4. Prayer is allowed.",
